--- !u!114 &5128280778142857131
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a32a464d8ccff4e40a60c45b40a1e648, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sentence Node
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp-firstpass::cherrydev.SentenceNode
  NodeGraph: {fileID: 11400000}
  Rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2099
    y: 241.5
    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Avant
    Text: "The King\u2026 He had an illegitimate child. That he was planning on recognizing
      as his heir. He knew he was old and unfit to rule and figured it was best to
      come out and declare it while he was still alive so his word would hold more
      weight."
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -4583758162744181447, guid: 308da7f8ff69dc04190585d5e3c6e8da, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
  - {fileID: -2428536568738158784}
  ChildNode: {fileID: -1631527351224849173}
  _isExternalFunc: 0
  _externalFunctionName: 
  CharacterNameKey: 
  SentenceTextKey: 
--- !u!114 &5173437448618743654
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a32a464d8ccff4e40a60c45b40a1e648, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sentence Node
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp-firstpass::cherrydev.SentenceNode
  NodeGraph: {fileID: 11400000}
  Rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2615
    y: 299.5
    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 0
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Avant
    Text: Adrianne was not anticipated for at all and scared him off. But it seems
      most of the document was ripped, only this part remained intact.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -4583758162744181447, guid: 308da7f8ff69dc04190585d5e3c6e8da, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
  - {fileID: -1631527351224849173}
  ChildNode: {fileID: -8303601220153635508}
  _isExternalFunc: 0
  _externalFunctionName: 
  CharacterNameKey: 
  SentenceTextKey: 
--- !u!114 &5556831087485632282
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a32a464d8ccff4e40a60c45b40a1e648, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sentence Node
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp-firstpass::cherrydev.SentenceNode
  NodeGraph: {fileID: 11400000}
  Rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: -249
    y: 570.5
    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Avant
    Text: In war, I've killed hundreds I never met. Murder in peacetime feels colder.
      At least in battle, the gunpowdered guns has purpose.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -4583758162744181447, guid: 308da7f8ff69dc04190585d5e3c6e8da, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
  - {fileID: 803300941970166249}
  ChildNode: {fileID: -1211290618911506022}
  _isExternalFunc: 0
  _externalFunctionName: 
  CharacterNameKey: 
  SentenceTextKey: 
